<NAME>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Post Handler Support</TUV>
</NAME>
<DESC>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Provide type of Post Service Handlers for All Protocol Services of Diagnostic class.
Restriction: Only evaluated if 'MainHandlerSupport' (on ProtocolService Level)' is set, i.e. unequal to 'none'.</TUV>
</DESC>
<QUAL>PostHandlerSupport</QUAL>
<ETAG v='0'>
