<NAME>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Packet Handler Option</TUV>
</NAME>
<DESC>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Provide type of current Packet Handler for first found Service Positive Response.
Restriction: Only evaluated if Folder attribute 'PacketHandlerSupport' is set to 'all'.</TUV>
</DESC>
