<NAME>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Power Down Time</TUV>
</NAME>
<DESC>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>This parameter indicates to the client the minimum time of the stand-by-sequence the server will remain in the power down sequence. The resolution of this parameter is one (1) secound per count. The follwing values are valid:
- 00 – FE hex: 0 – 254 seconds powerDownTime,
- FF hex: indicates a failure or time not available.</TUV>
</DESC>
<QUAL>powerDownTime</QUAL>
</DATAOBJ>
</SIMPLECOMPCONT>
