</NAME>
<DESC>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>This parameter is a one byte value with each nibble encoded separately (see annex G.1 for example values):
bit 7 - 4: Length (number of bytes) of the memorySize parameter
bit 3 - 0: Length (number of bytes) of the memoryAddress parameter</TUV>
</DESC>
<QUAL>addressAndLengthFormatIdentifier</QUAL>
</DATAOBJ>
