</NAME>
<DESC>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US' struct='1'><PARA><FC>The InputOutputControlByIdentifier service is used by the client to substitute a value for an input signal, internal server function and/or control an output (actuator) of an electronic system.</FC>
</PARA>
</TUV>
</DESC>
<QUAL>InputOutputControlByIdentifier</QUAL>
