</NAME>
<DESC>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>This parameter is used by the requestUpload positive response message to inform the client how many data bytes shall be included in each TransferData positive response message from the server. This length reflects the complete message length, including the service identifier and the data parameters present in the TransferData positve response message.</TUV>
