<NAME>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Block Sequence Counter</TUV>
</NAME>
<DESC>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>The blockSequenceCounter parameter value starts at 01 hex with the first TransferData request that follows the RequestDownload (34 hex) or RequestUpload (35 hex) service. Its value is incremented by 1 for each subsequent TransferData request. At the value of FF hex the blockSequenceCounter rolls over and starts at 00 hex with the next TransferData request message.</TUV>
</DESC>
<QUAL>blockSequenceCounter</QUAL>
</DATAOBJ>
</SIMPLECOMPCONT>
<SIMPLECOMPCONT oid='B1780D6584204441B97064325A4F54AF' temploid='E2E33AF332A34c7bA3BBB6973D08C8AF' shproxyref='_0000000020E8A820'>
