<NAME>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Timing Parameter Request Record</TUV>
</NAME>
<DESC>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>This parameter record contains the timing parameter values read from the server via timingParameterAccessType = readExtendedTimingParameterSet or readCurrentlyActiveTimingParameters. The content and structure of this parameter record is data link layer specific and can be found in the implementation specification(s) of ISO/DIS 14229-1.2.</TUV>
</DESC>
<QUAL>timingParameterRequestRecord</QUAL>
</DATAOBJ>
</SIMPLECOMPCONT>
