<NAME>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>($85) ControlDTCSetting</TUV>
</NAME>
<DESC>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US' struct='1'><PARA><FC>The ControlDTCSetting service shall be used by a client to stop or resume the setting of diagnostic trouble codes (DTC's) in the server(s).</FC>
</PARA>
</TUV>
</DESC>
<QUAL>ControlDTCSetting</QUAL>
