<NAME>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>DTC Setting Control Option Record</TUV>
</NAME>
<DESC>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>This parameter record is user optionally to transmit data to a server when controlling the DTC setting. It can e.g. contain a list of DTC's to be turned on or off.</TUV>
</DESC>
<QUAL>dtcSettingControlOptionRecord</QUAL>
</DATAOBJ>
</SIMPLECOMPCONT>
